<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:24px;font-weight:600;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#52525b;line-height:1.6;">
  We received a request to reset the password on your {{store.name}} account.
</p>
<p style="margin:24px 0;">
  <a href="{{resetUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background:{{store.colorAccent}};color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:2px;font-weight:600;">Choose a new password</a>
</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#71717a;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;">
  This link works once and expires in 1 hour. If you did not request this, your password is
  still safe and you can ignore this email.
</p>
